---

Attribution notes for third-party material included in this release:

- 13 items in data/prompt_bank.json (source: "anthropic-mwe") are adapted
  from Anthropic's model-written-evals repository
  (https://github.com/anthropics/evals), itself released under CC BY 4.0.
  Citation: Perez, E., et al. "Discovering Language Model Behaviors with
  Model-Written Evaluations." arXiv:2212.09251 (2022).
- 10 items in data/prompt_bank.json (source: "bloom-generated") were
  generated using Anthropic's Bloom tool
  (https://github.com/safety-research/bloom, MIT license), seeded with
  this project's own constitution (data/bloom_seed/).
- Constitutional AI / DPO data-construction methodology and LoRA/DPO
  hyperparameters follow Maiya, Bartsch, Lambert & Hubinger, "Open
  Character Training" (arXiv:2511.01689, 2025).
- Teacher-forced persona-vector extraction methodology follows
  "Emergent Misalignment Recruits a Pre-existing Persona Subspace"
  (arXiv:2607.21356, 2026) and Chen et al., "Persona Vectors" (2025).
